<title>UK: Royal Dutch /Shell Q1 profits flat.</title>
<headline>Royal Dutch /Shell Q1 profits flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>				 (billion stg unless stated)</p>
<p>Current cost net income excluding special items</p>
<p>				1.545		  1.535</p>
<p>Current cost net income including special items</p>
<p>				1.545		  1.625</p>
<p>Net income		  1.416		  1.743</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast current cost before exceptional items in a range between 1.355 billion and 1.736 billion stg.</p>
<p>Note - Royal Dutch/Shell Group is some 60 percent owned by Royal Dutch Petroleum Co of the Netherlands and 40 percent by Britain's Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc.</p>
</text>
